@page "/AutofitExamples"
@using BlazorDatasheet.SharedPages.Components.Examples.Autofit
<h3>Autofit</h3>

<div class="block">
    Autofit will expand row and/or column sizes to fit the cell contents. Autofit can be performed automatically on text
    entry, or on demand programmatically.
</div>

<div class="block">
    Below the column widths will expand when the text entered is larger than the cell size.
</div>

<CodeExample ComponentType="typeof(AutofitOnTextEntry)"/>

<div class="block">Below the autofit is performed on demand. Anything in the region will be used for the autofit. When contract is set, the cells may reduce in size to fit,
    otherwise the autofit will only expand to fit the largest value.
</div>

<CodeExample ComponentType="typeof(AutoFitRegion)"/>

